{
  "slug": "tk",
  "name": "Tk",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Spec-driven workflow for AI coding agents: PRD, plan, check, and archive features using tracer-bullet vertical slices.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `brief` (Session briefing — shows active features, progress, and suggested focus), `build` (Implement one phase of a plan), `check` (Verify implementation against plan), `plan` (Turn a PRD into a multi-phase implementation plan using tracer-bullet vertical slices), `prd` (Create a PRD through user interview, codebase exploration, and module design)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tk@claude-community` from `helderberto/tracerkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
